WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.085
Across the real single-cell task, NubOT outperforms
every baseline,

00:00:04.165 --> 00:00:07.442
including the current state-of-the-art unbalanced GAN,

00:00:07.522 --> 00:00:10.674
in almost all of the twenty-five drug perturbations,

00:00:10.754 --> 00:00:17.699
measured by a weighted version of kernel maximum
mean discrepancy between predicted and observed perturbed cells.

00:00:17.779 --> 00:00:18.942
Just as importantly,

00:00:19.022 --> 00:00:24.412
it does so while getting the mass changes right: on
the synthetic benchmark it maps each

00:00:24.492 --> 00:00:28.639
cluster to its correct target without leaking mass
between clusters,

00:00:28.719 --> 00:00:32.183
and it predicts the exact reweighting each cluster needs,

00:00:32.263 --> 00:00:37.218
where the GAN baseline only captures the broad
direction of growth and shrinkage.

00:00:37.298 --> 00:00:43.310
This combination of accurate feature mapping and
accurate mass rescaling is what sets NubOT apart.
